ります。（ケモ耳と人耳は共存しません）\n人耳にはピンクのハートイヤリングがついています\n―――――――――――――――――――――\n\n頭や体がキャンパス内に収まるように描いていただけると幸いです。\nまた、人物の透過PNGやPSDデータを頂けますと幸いです！\n\n※SNSでの使用やサムネでの使用また、グッズなどの商用利用を含む場合があります。\n\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ucQlsrJtnNn3eAmDmr0RrGQFZ6EiiZho?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1825019, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "とのじ", "screen_name": "TOTOTOTO_TK", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2035836851207163904/ujGU9y_F.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/362002239/1739467323/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 2344303, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "よくと", "screen_name": "yokuto_h", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fwebpublic-be8858ae-da85-42a4-8b22-ce3a5555ea06.png?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/6be08e29-3eb1-4dbf-90f3-9bffcfdce5d7.gif", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 2675471, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "那智くゆる🍀☁️", "screen_name": "kyr_jp", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998724315236409345/x4TTnaio.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1417611663801405446/1736861834/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular